      "type": 1,
      "name": "availability-label",
      "content": {
        "json": "### Reported availability by deployment (%)\nPlatform average availability uses server errors (HTTP 5xx), not all unsuccessful requests; 429 and 4xx are not included. Availability can be reported even in intervals with no traffic. Compare with the status breakdown before drawing conclusions."
      }
    },
